        <p class="text-sm mb-3 whitespace-pre-line">19 Jan &#123;tip 本週六(1/20) 學術比賽👉考場教室配置表 👉 IHS 學校地圖 以下為學術比賽的幾項提醒: 遲到五分鐘以上之參賽學生，不准進入考場教室。 進入考場前，請將手機關關機或者轉為靜音放入書包，並將書包置於教室前方或者監考老師指定地方。若手機置於桌上或手持手機，一律取消資格。 所有比賽項目考卷皆已編號，考卷上不可以寫名字或班級名稱。違反規定者取消比賽資格。 學分班學生比賽完畢後，請向監考老師領取學分班參賽證明，並請監考老師簽字。 請參賽學生比賽結束後，向監考老師領取 PTA禮券兌換券。每張兌換券可換取PTA抵用券$1。 中打參賽者請自備電腦和電源線。 西畫和卡通參賽者，請自備繪畫工具和顏料。題目由監考老師當場公布，畫紙由學校提供，請勿使用噴漆作畫。 鉛筆書法, 閱讀測驗, 翻譯, 漢語拼音和注音比賽參賽者，請記得攜帶自己的筆和橡皮擦。 書法和國畫請自備紙張，書法紙張請在家先摺好格子。紙張於報到時交由監考老師檢查無任何標記。紙張若有標記者一律取消資格。 &#125;Saturday (1/20) is the FCS academic contest day. 👉Academic Contest Items/Classrooms 👉 IHS School Map Here are some reminders for the Academic Contest: Contestant is NOT allowed to enter the classroom if more than 5 minutes late. All contestants need to turn off their cellphone, or switch to silent mode, then put the cellphone inside their backpack. Please put the backpack in front of the classroom or at a designated location as per proctor’s instruction. If a cellphone is found on the contestant’s desk, or on the contestant during the contest, the contestant will be disqualified. All contest papers are labeled. No name and classroom number are allowed to be written on the contest papers. Any violation will be disqualified. AC students (Class: 201, 302, 304, 403, 503) need to get a proof of contest after completing their event. Do not forget to ask the proctor to sign the proof. All contestants will receive a $1 PTA coupon after each contest event. Chinese Typing contestants will need to bring their own laptop and power cord. Western Drawing and Cartoon contestants need to bring their own paint, paint tools, and accessories. The contest theme will be announced by the proctor. The school will provide the drawing paper. No spray paint is allowed. Contestants participating in the Pencil Calligraphy, Reading Comprehension, Bilingual Translation, Zhuyin Phonetics and Pinyin Phonetics need to bring their own pencil and eraser. Contestants participating in Chinese Brush Calligraphy and Chinese Painting need to bring their own papers. Chinese Brush Calligraphy contestants need to fold the paper into grids in advance. All papers need to be checked without any marks by the proctors. Any violation will be disqualified. &#123;/tip&#125;</p>
