      <div class="rounded-lg p-4" style="background: var(--color-fcs-surface, #f8f8f8);">
        <p class="text-sm mb-3 whitespace-pre-line">28 Aug &#123;tip 各位家長們好, 離9月9日開學的日子不已經不遠了，在此提醒家長們，若還未上網註冊的，請儘快完成註冊及繳費程序，以免課程因額滿而無法加收或因人數不足而取消。 在此也再次說明本校為非營利組織，除教師以外，所有幹事上至校長及副校長全為不支薪的義工，幹事人數有限，校園的安全需要靠所有家長來維護，被通知到需要輪職的家長們，請務必報到認真值勤。Irvington 校區為開放式校區，尤其中低年級的學生家長們，需要特別注意孩童接送、下課時甚至課堂中需要用洗手間時的安全，如果有上才藝課，需要更換教室，家長應自行陪同。老師經常需要利用下課時間與辦公室聯絡校務事宜，無法負責看管所有學生下課時的行為，我們希望家長們盡到自行照顧的責任，以保學生安全。另外，由於教室空間有限，為確保教學品質，中低年級的學生家長們，請儘量與老師配合、尊重老師的需求、與老師討論以決定家長應否全部留在教室陪同或輪流安排值星家長陪同。謝謝大家的配合！ &#125;Dear parents, The summer vacation is almost over and the new school year will start on 9/9. This is to remind you if you haven&#39;t registered yet then please complete the registration and payment as soon as possible. There might be a risk of the classes being full or cancelled if you don&#39;t register soon. Once again, we remind you all that FCS is a non profit organization. Other than the teachers, all staffs including the principal and vice principal are volunteers. We have very limited staff; therefore, we rely on all parents&#39; help to ensure the campus security. When you receive the notification for the security duty, please make sure you report to the security group on your duty day. Irvington High School is an open campus, and the parents need to pay attention to the safety during pick up, drop off, recess, and even when the students need to use the restroom during class. Parents have the responsibility to accompany their children while changing classrooms if they have elective classes, especially for the younger students. Teachers won&#39;t be able to watch the students during recess because they need to take care of some routine duties during recess. We hope all parents take their own responsibility to ensure the students&#39; safety. In addition, there are only limited seats available in the classrooms. Parents should cooperate with their teachers and respect the teachers&#39; requirements. For the parents of younger students, please work closely with the teacher to decide either to stay in the classroom or to have a weekly representative to stay in the classroom. Thank you for your cooperation! &#123;/tip&#125;</p>
